### ============================================
### MENU SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/discounts

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/discounts
@id = 1
@referenceId = 1

### Create a discounts item
### Request Body: DiscountDto
### Response: Created DiscountDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Sale",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "amount": 15.00,
  "appliesTo": "CATEGORY",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "startDate": "2024-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-07-31T23:59:59Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### Get discounts by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: DiscountDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all discounts in a reference
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<DiscountDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/reference/{referenceId}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update discounts by ID
### Request Body: DiscountDto
### Response: Updated DiscountDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete discounts by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json